; Handwritten fixture: separate column/row MINSERT, missing block, zero X/Y
; scales, a multiline ATTDEF and a multiline ATTRIB. The last INSERT must remain raw as a whole.
; 100 is the supported control: the case becomes mandatory only with PT18.
D = DXF file=dati.dxf
? roundtrip D -> identical
? roundtrip D as=cadx -> identical
; cambia con #697
? entity D 100 -> INSERT block="SIMPLE" insertion=0,0 scale=1,1 rotation=0
? entity D 101 -> unhandled INSERT
? entity D 102 -> unhandled INSERT
? entity D 103 -> unhandled INSERT
? entity D 104 -> unhandled INSERT
? entity D 105 -> unhandled INSERT
? entity D 106 -> unhandled INSERT
? entity D 109 -> unhandled ATTDEF
